      "username": "grysqrl",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-17T02:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've played that game. It's really hard. None of them have any ongoing destruction. The only rule that we played with, which should be relatively obvious but is still worth stating, is that any hero card that says \"Legacy\" only refers to that particular Legacy, not all of them.</p>",
